### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

### Get Profile
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Create Link Token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plaid/create_link_token
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Exchange Public Token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plaid/exchange_public_token
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "public_token": "public-sandbox-xxx"
}

### Get Accounts
GET http://localhost:3000/api/plaid/accounts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Transactions
POST http://localhost:3000/api/plaid/transactions
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2025-09-01",
  "end_date": "2025-10-01"
}

### Get All Credit Cards
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cards
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Save Credit Card Configuration
POST http://localhost:3000/api/cards
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": "account-abc123",
  "name": "Chase Freedom",
  "mask": "1234",
  "credit_limit": 10000.00,
  "statement_date": 15,
  "due_date": 10,
  "auto_pay_enabled": true,
  "auto_pay_amount": 1500.00
}

### Get Specific Credit Card
GET http://localhost:3000/api/cards/account-abc123
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete Credit Card
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/cards/account-abc123
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Remove Plaid Item
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/plaid/items/item-abc123
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

